          "care": "Wipe it with a damp cloth and dry it off. No dishwasher — the heat opens the grain and lifts the oil.\nWhen the surface starts looking dry and pale, rub in a little food-safe oil and leave it overnight.\nRings and marks sand out with 240 grit if you ever need to start again.",
