          },
          "tint": "#c2a175",
          "reorder_at": 6,
          "cost": 3.2,
          "care": "Indoors only. Ply and rain do not get on, and a wet edge will lift within a season.\nDust it, and wipe spills off quickly rather than letting them soak in.\nIf it was waxed, a fresh coat once a year keeps the face even.",
