          "tint": "#6f8299",
          "reorder_at": 4,
          "cost": 5.1,
          "care": "Warm soapy water and a soft cloth. Solvent cleaners cloud the surface permanently.\nIt scuffs with use, which is what keys and cake tins do to things.\nCheck the split ring on a keyring or a pet tag every few months.",
